# D31: npm package ships only genesis genes (rotifer init needs them).
# All other genes are available via Rotifer Cloud (D1: Cloud-Centric Gene ecosystem).
# See: internal/plan/rotifer-playground-repo-tidy-plan.md §13.3

# Default: exclude everything
*

# Keep genesis genes required by `rotifer init` (resolveGenesisDir)
!genesis-web-search/
!genesis-web-search/**
!genesis-web-search-lite/
!genesis-web-search-lite/**
!genesis-file-read/
!genesis-file-read/**
!genesis-code-format/
!genesis-code-format/**
!genesis-l0-constraint/
!genesis-l0-constraint/**
